        "abstract": "A recursive relation is derived for calculation of the coefficients of a power series from the roots of a product series. For complex roots the expression evolves into two real recursive relations, one each for the real and imaginary parts of the coefficients. The usefulness of the algorithm is illustrated by calculating the weights of a steerable antenna array from its zeros.",
